-- A matcher can leave a global ranking operand without changing its candidates.
-- SQLNESS SORT_RESULT 3 1
TQL EVAL (0, 0, '1s') topk(1, matching_groups_left{host="x"}) / on(host,zone) matching_groups_right;

Error: 3001(EngineExecuteQuery), Execution error: found duplicate series for the match group {zone="a"} on the right hand-side of the operation at 0 ms; many-to-many matching not allowed: matching labels must be unique on one side

